      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ENTRYPOINT is the coffee\nmachine: it always runs.\nCMD is the cup size: a\ndefault you can change.\n\nTo change the machine itself,\nyou have to ask for it with\n--entrypoint.",
